                <p>See telegrams 1072 and 1073, March 30, to Bern, <ref target="frus1944v05#pg_1085"
                        >vol. <hi rendition="#small-caps">v</hi>, pp. 1085</ref> and <ref
                        target="frus1944v05#pg_1087">1087</ref>, respectively.</p>
